  "native_authored_context": [
    {
      "name": "TSCultPottSeals90-2",
      "text_sha256": "91f54d78d153ee9ee5a97c476bde0086ad95281af5c104e0d1e2c5cdd1653b5a",
      "txtfile": "...This appears to be the `second half of a torn`tome...``````````After much trial and error `I have compiled the `following to be a list of `valid location and `enchantment combinations.``All of these firings will `require a High Quality `Firing Sheet.````In addition, all of these `fired seals will use the `appropriate Unfired Soloist`Dream Seal for a particular`location.````````The following seals require`a Quill of the Arcane:``Soloist Dream Glove Seal of`the Cryomancer`  E'ci's Ink Additive`  Ink of E'ci``Soloist Dream Sleeve Seal `of the Pyromancer`  Ro's Ink Additive`  Ink of Ro`Soloist Dream Helm Seal of `the Arcanist`  Luclin's Ink Additive`  Ink of Druzzil Ro` `Soloist Dream Wrist Seal of`the Assassin`  Saryrn's Ink Additive`  Ink of Saryrn````Soloist Dream Wrist Seal of`the Defiler`  Bertoxxulous' Ink `  Additive`  Ink of Bertoxxulous``Soloist Dream Wrist Seal of`the Stargazer`  Quill of the Arcane`  Veeshan's Ink Additive`  Ink of Rainbows``These seals require a`Quill of the Divine:``Soloist Dream Boot Seal of `the Seafarer`  Ink Additive of the `  Nameless`  Ink of Alacrity`````Soloist Dream Legging Seal `of the Traveler`  Ink Additive of the `  Nameless`  Ink of Alacrity``Soloist Dream Sleeve Seal `of the Healer`  Ink Additive of the `  Nameless`  Ink of Tunare``Soloist Dream Wrist Seal of`the Healer`  Ink Additive of the `  Nameless`  Ink of Tunare``These seals require a`Quill of the Martial:``Soloist Dream Sleeve Seal `of the Warchief`  Rallos' Ink Additive`  Ink of Catastrophe``Soloist Dream Legging Seal `of the Berserker`  Rallos' Ink Additive`  Ink of Deftness``Soloist Dream Glove Seal of`the Drummer`  Zebuxoruk's Ink Additive`  Ink of the Cat``Soloist Dream Helm Seal of `the Farseer`  Zebuxoruk's Ink Additive`  Ink of the Eagle``Soloist Dream Boot Seal of `the Singer`  Zebuxoruk's Ink Additive`  Ink of the Monkey````The quills required for`these seals are unique:``Soloist Dream Sleeve Seal `of the Firechief`  Quill of the Martial`  Rallos' Ink Additive`  Ink of Catastrophe`  Quill of the Arcane`  Ro's Ink Additive`  Ink of Ro`  Dream Dust`Soloist Dream Legging Seal `of the Venturer`  Quill of the Martial`  Rallos' Ink Additive`  Ink of Deftness`  Quill of the Divine`  Ink Additive of the `  Nameless`  Ink of Alacrity`  Dream Dust```Additionally, you can make `a chest seal of any of the `seals; simply replace the `unfired seal with an `unfired chest seal. The `only change is in the `Firechief and Venturer `seals. The chest symbol is `larger and more able to `hold the power, so the `dream dust is not required.``Additionally, for some `reason, a Soloist Dream `Chest Seal of the Traveler `will require an extra Ink `of Alacrity.^"
    },
    {
      "name": "TSSKU20CuPoSeal100-2",
      "text_sha256": "0db8f5f48307c33f4d08f2323c6ad9ab01ccdbfd3daed04d7a977cdf58bd329a",
      "txtfile": "SEALS OF THE SOLOIST `Planar`- Book Two -``This tome contains a list `of valid location and `enchantment combinations `for Planar Seals.``All of these firings will `require a High Quality `Firing Sheet.`In addition, all of these `fired seals will use the `appropriate Unfired Soloist`Planar Seal for a `particular location.````````The following seals require`a Quill of the Arcane:``Soloist Planar Glove `Seal of the Cryomancer`-E'ci's Ink Additive`-Ink of E'ci``Soloist Planar Sleeve `Seal of the Pyromancer`-Ro's Ink Additive`-Ink of Ro`Soloist Planar Helm`Seal of the Arcanist`-Luclin's Ink Additive`-Ink of Druzzil Ro` `Soloist Planar Wrist `Seal of the Assassin`-Saryrn's Ink Additive`-Ink of Saryrn````Soloist Planar Wrist`Seal of the Defiler`-Bertoxxulous' Ink Additive`-Ink of Bertoxxulous``Soloist Planar Wrist`Seal of the Stargazer`-Quill of the Arcane`-Veeshan's Ink Additive`-Ink of Rainbows```These seals require a`Quill of the Divine:``Soloist Planar Boot`Seal of the Seafarer`-Ink Additive of ` the Nameless` -Ink of Alacrity`````Soloist Planar Legging`Seal of the Traveler`-Ink Additive of ` the Nameless`-Ink of Alacrity``Soloist Planar Sleeve`Seal of the Healer`-Ink Additive of the ` Nameless`-Ink of Tunare``Soloist Planar Wrist`Seal of the Healer`-Ink Additive of the ` Nameless`-Ink of Tunare````````These seals require a`Quill of the Martial:``Soloist Planar Sleeve`Seal of the Warchief`-Rallos' Ink Additive`-Ink of Catastrophe``Soloist Planar Legging`Seal of the Berserker`-Rallos' Ink Additive`-Ink of Deftness`Soloist Planar Glove `Seal of the Drummer`-Zebuxoruk's Ink Additive`-Ink of the Cat``Soloist Planar Helm`Seal of the Farseer`-Zebuxoruk's Ink Additive`-Ink of the Eagle````Soloist Planar Boot`Seal of the Singer`-Zebuxoruk's Ink Additive`-Ink of the Monkey`The quills required for`these seals are unique:``Soloist Planar Sleeve `Seal of the Firechief`-Quill of the Martial`-Rallos' Ink Additive`-Ink of Catastrophe`-Quill of the Arcane`-Ro's Ink Additive`-Ink of Ro`-Planar Energy Shard`Soloist Planar Legging `Seal of the Venturer`-Quill of the Martial`-Rallos' Ink Additive`-Ink of Deftness`-Quill of the Divine`-Ink Additive of the ` Nameless`-Ink of Alacrity`-Planar Energy Shard``You can make a chest seal `of any of the `seals; simply replace the `unfired seal with an `unfired chest seal. The `only change is in the `Firechief and Venturer `seals. The chest symbol is `larger and more able to `hold the power, so the `Planar Energy Shard is not `required.`Additionally, a Soloist `Planar`Chest Seal of the Traveler `will require an extra Ink `of Alacrity.`^"
    }
